1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,980
I threw a stool at my landlord.

2
00:00:01,980 --> 00:00:02,520
I'm Mara.

3
00:00:02,520 --> 00:00:06,190
He stole the fuse that keeps my
cat alive, and I want it back.

4
00:00:06,950 --> 00:00:09,150
He put my best
friend in his pocket.

5
00:00:09,250 --> 00:00:11,170
It's only a fuse, Miss Reyes.

6
00:00:11,170 --> 00:00:13,000
You'll hardly miss him.

7
00:00:13,050 --> 00:00:14,310
Give him back.

8
00:00:14,410 --> 00:00:15,350
No.

9
00:00:15,640 --> 00:00:17,850
So I threw a stool
at my landlord.

10
00:00:18,660 --> 00:00:21,220
That is coming out
of your deposit.

11
00:00:21,520 --> 00:00:23,520
Then the other me lit one word.

12
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:24,020
Go.

13
00:00:24,520 --> 00:00:24,950
He ran.

14
00:00:24,950 --> 00:00:26,540
Past a hundred dead signs.

15
00:00:26,540 --> 00:00:28,860
And every one of
them was a name.

16
00:00:29,460 --> 00:00:32,810
Careful! Break the ring,
and they all go out.

17
00:00:33,010 --> 00:00:34,880
I only wanted the green one.

18
00:00:35,880 --> 00:00:38,000
Cautious! I was going
to say cautious.

19
00:00:38,090 --> 00:00:39,920
Don't you ever do that again.

20
00:00:40,130 --> 00:00:41,940
Wait. You threw a stool? For me?

21
00:00:42,540 --> 00:00:45,080
And then I saw the
tag on the next fuse.

22
00:00:46,070 --> 00:00:47,520
Mara? That's your mom.

23
00:00:48,320 --> 00:00:50,590
Nine years. And
it was still warm.
